WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:20.059
Tom and Cat were walking in the rain.

2
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:27.039
The new jester was at the blacksmith shop.

3
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:31.168
"Why isn't the jester practicing?" asked Tom.

4
00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:34.324
"The Grand Banquet is tomorrow!"

5
00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:38.781
"Maybe he needs tin plates to juggle," Cat said.

6
00:00:38.782 --> 00:00:41.524
"True," Tom said.

7
00:00:41.525 --> 00:00:45.221
"He can't break more of the queen's dishes!"

8
00:00:45.222 --> 00:00:57.817
But the jester did not buy tin plates.

9
00:00:57.818 --> 00:01:07.002
The jester was just taking a walk.

10
00:01:07.003 --> 00:01:15.112
Suddenly he stopped near the castle wall.

11
00:01:15.113 --> 00:01:22.555
He looked closely at a crack.

12
00:01:22.556 --> 00:01:25.662
"That's strange," Cat said.

13
00:01:25.663 --> 00:01:28.945
"The jester looks worried," Tom said.

14
00:01:28.946 --> 00:01:31.206
"Maybe I can help."

15
00:01:31.207 --> 00:01:38.054
"You have a kind heart," Cat said.

16
00:01:38.055 --> 00:01:40.837
"Jester!" Tom called.

17
00:01:40.838 --> 00:01:43.610
The jester jumped.

18
00:01:43.611 --> 00:01:46.012
He looked ready to run away.

19
00:01:46.013 --> 00:01:51.450
"Stop! I want to help," Tom said.

20
00:01:51.451 --> 00:01:55.413
The jester looked sad.

21
00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:58.598
"I'm Tink the Tinker," he said.

22
00:01:58.599 --> 00:02:00.544
"I fix things.

23
00:02:00.545 --> 00:02:03.000
I don't know how to be a jester."

24
00:02:03.001 --> 00:02:05.398
"It's easy," Tom said.

25
00:02:05.399 --> 00:02:10.557
"Jump into the air and flip around."

26
00:02:10.558 --> 00:02:12.690
Tink jumped and flipped.

27
00:02:12.691 --> 00:02:14.921
Then he flopped.

28
00:02:14.922 --> 00:02:17.401
"Oops," Tom said.

29
00:02:17.402 --> 00:02:23.180
"Try dancing a jig instead."

30
00:02:23.181 --> 00:02:32.407
Tink danced.

31
00:02:32.408 --> 00:02:39.328
He knocked over a pile of tomatoes.

32
00:02:39.329 --> 00:02:44.425
"Dirk is going to be very mad!" Tink said.

33
00:02:44.426 --> 00:02:52.338
He hurried away.

34
00:02:52.339 --> 00:02:54.856
Cat licked her paws.

35
00:02:54.857 --> 00:03:00.663
"The Grand Banquet will be interesting," she said.

